      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "Non-consumable: buy the hoodie once and own it. Preview simulates the purchase until Preview restarts."
        - "Consumable: each purchase credits 100 coins in a delivery handler, then CommerceKit consumes it. Buy again any time."
        - "Subscription: shows the offer and renewal status. Preview does not simulate subscriptions; test on device."
